    "skill.core.farming": "Farming",
    "skill.core.farming.description": "Sowing, tending and harvesting crops, and keeping and breeding animals.",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.0": "Forage wild crops for their seeds, and sow them on soil near water",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.1": "Keep and breed junglefowl and rabbits; collect eggs",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.10": "Rabbits in high aether can become moonhares",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.11": "Inspecting shows hidden genes and carriers",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.12": "Keep ember salamanders",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.13": "Aether feed raises the chance of mutation",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.14": "Keep crystal tortoises",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.15": "Keep griffins",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.16": "Keep silver harts; harvests find rare produce a little more often",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.2": "Keep mallards",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.3": "Keep mouflon and shear them; make compost",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.4": "Keep pigs; they root for truffles",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.5": "Keep ibex and milk them; harvests find uncommon produce a little more often",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.6": "Keep bees in skeps for honey and wax",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.7": "Keep aurochs; inspecting an animal shows its visible genes",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.8": "Keep horses; the studbook tracks lineage and inbreeding",
    "skill.core.farming.guide.9": "Keep camels and donkeys; breed mules",
